Hmm, let me look at the `md_process_line` function again. In the TABLEUNDERLINE case:
```c
if(line->type == MD_LINE_TABLEUNDERLINE) {
    MD_ASSERT(ctx->current_block != NULL);
    MD_ASSERT(ctx->current_block->n_lines == 1);
